# bad_angled.sm -- A hole along z through the plate and a flange over it
# Copyright (c) 2026 Jakob Kastelic

# The hole runs through every slab across z, so also through the flange
# folded back over the plate at an angle.
sheet 1.5 1 0.44
plate p 0 0 60 40 origin 0 0 0 axes +x +y
flange f p +x 140 20
hole 4 50 20 along z
